o, in the future, please don't use such vague language when describing the use of AI, \"drafted\" here is far too vague to describe \"it wrote the entire thing\"","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4530051457/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4531057548","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119698#issuecomment-4531057548","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119698","id":4531057548,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDhJzjA","user":{"login":"iMacHumphries","id":10065149,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDY1MTQ5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10065149?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries","html_url":"https://github.com/iMacHumphries","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/iMacHumphries/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-05-25T02:26:43Z","updated_at":"2026-05-25T02:26:43Z","body":"@AThousandShips I agree that the aI notice was vague.  I think that “it wrote the entire thing” is mischaracterization of my work here.  This is not a vibe coded implementation.  I used Claude to explore APIs and generate boilerplate based on the existing macOS/Windows/Linux AccessKit implementations. The generated draft did not work correctly for numerous reasons that I debugged and fixed.  99% of this PR is boilerplate.  If I did not use AI to generate a draft, then code would be identical because it is just copy pasted from the macOS implementation.\r\n\r\nI marked the PR as AI drafted because I was trying to be transparent, not imply authorship was delegated to Claude entirely. If the concern is specifically around attribution wording, I’m happy to update the AI notice.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4531057548/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4531993996","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119698#issuecomment-4531993996","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119698","id":4531993996,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABDiC9jA","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://ap